    "detailed_description": "<h1>Steam Trading Cards!</h1><p>You can get Steam Trading Cards right now!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/866510/extras/035e25cfe4e7977375d7f897a0366a8f.avif?t=1750674940\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Let's Return to Our Past!</strong></h2>An unusual world for an unusual person. Attempts of scientists to recreate the time machine lost after unsuccessful tests turned into a failure! The protagonist Joy, got into the times of retro vision! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>5000 achievements</strong><br></li><li> Hard parkour<br></li><li> More than 10 hard levels<br></li><li> A few secrets<br></li><li> Two free characters and four paid<br></li><li> The game is translated into 8 languages</li></ul>So why do not you come and experience the torment of Joy?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Let's Return to Our Past!</strong></h2>An unusual world for an unusual person. Attempts of scientists to recreate the time machine lost after unsuccessful tests turned into a failure! The protagonist Joy, got into the times of retro vision! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>5000 achievements</strong><br></li><li> Hard parkour<br></li><li> More than 10 hard levels<br></li><li> A few secrets<br></li><li> Two free characters and four paid<br></li><li> The game is translated into 8 languages</li></ul>So why do not you come and experience the torment of Joy?",
    "short_description": "Do you like parkour? Dashing retro times? AnyWay! Try yourself on an unsuccessful journey in the role of Joy, feel the burden of parkour! A small, but exciting adventure Joy will not make you relax, not for you, not for your friends!",
